## 2026-08-28 open-ended-gen-time-honesty-tokenid-continuation (isolated worktree agent-aafef44fca8bc3d2c)
Updated #112 ("Let the brain talk freely (open-ended), staying honest") with the retokenization-limit fix:
`_open_ended_gen_time_consensus_veto_derisk.py`'s mouth-stepping loop now carries the growing reply as
token ids (a kept sentence continues from the model's own generated tokens, zero re-encode; only a
repaired sentence re-encodes its own edited span) instead of decoding to a string and re-tokenizing the
